{"hw":"κήλη","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">κήλη</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">κήλη</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">κάλη</span> [prob.<span class=\"gk\">α], <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span> </span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">tumour</b>; esp. <b class=\"lex-tr\">rupture, hernia</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Aër.</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span> (pl.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.166</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lucill.</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.342</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">hump</b> on a buffalo's back, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">606a16</span> </span>, in acc. pl. <span class=\"gk\">κάλας</span> ( v.l. χαίτας ); in human beings, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eup.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">276.1</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.729</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Artem.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.45</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">καλήτης καὶ κάλη Ἀττικοί.., κηλήτης καὶ κήλη Ἴωνες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phryn.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PS</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.81</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> </span> (Cf. ONorse <b class=\"lex-tr\">haull</b>, OSlav. <b class=\"lex-tr\">kyla</b>, both <abbr>=</abbr> <b class=\"lex-tr\">hernia.</b>)</div></div>"}